 The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Added
+
+- `Registry::add_transforms(transforms)`: all-or-nothing batch insert.
+  Equivalent to an `add_transform` loop on success (a later transform
+  may use a frame an earlier one creates as its parent, and later
+  writes win), and reports the loop's first error on failure with the
+  registry unchanged: nothing created, stored, replaced or evicted.
+  The error does not name the offending transform.
+
 ## [2.2.0] - 2026-09-27
 
 ### Added
